---
/**
 * <Step> — one numbered beat inside an <Explainer>.
 *
 * Auto-numbered via the parent <ol class="explainer__steps">. Authors
 * never type "1.", "2." etc. — re-ordering steps is safe.
 *
 * Per the contract (explainers.test.ts):
 *   - every step has at least one <p> paragraph
 *   - no step's paragraph text exceeds 150 words
 *   - the first step contains no <MathExpression> and no <TryThis>
 *     (it is the hook)
 *   - the last step contains at least one cross-reference (another
 *     demo title or Featured Problem title from the same course)
 */
---

<li class="explainer__step">
  <slot />
</li>
